window.products.push({"id":821006,"name":"KOK KAY Water Bottle Organizer, Stackable Bamboo Water Bottle Holder, 20 Freestanding Wine Rack Storage - 4-Layer Adjustable Water Bottles Storage Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nr3Ls3iIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality & Multiple Functions】Born for Water Bottles and Wine Bottle! The water bottle organizer is made of 100% natural bamboo, solid and durable, comes with high quality SUS304 self-drilling screws, and the surface is covered with high quality paints and finely polished by hand, with the texture being delicate and smooth to the touch. 【UP to 160LBS Load Capacity】Each layer has up to 40LBS support capacity! Made of solid bamboo, thickened partition, sturdy enough to hold different sizes water bottles. Bottles are stored horizontally and firmly in individual compartments and with the separate non-slip design of the base, and you'd never have to worry about bottles wobbling and tilting. 【Unique and Novel Design】The dividers on the shelf can be freely adjusted to the width you need, Each slot can be perfectly matched, your bottles of all sizes can remain stable and independent on the water bottle storage rack by adjusting the distance between the dividers. The ergononic design handle on both sides ensures your water cup stand more stylish and beautiful, you can easily lift it. 【Idea Bottles Storage】This multi-use rack is great for storing water bottles, glass water bottles, sport water bottles, wine bottles, water cups, insulated bottles and many more. Keep your kitchen, dining room, cabinet, home bar, tables, pantries, cupboards neat and organized with our bamboo water bottle holder. 【Easy to Assemble】Instructions and hardware are all included! Simply follow the instructions inside the package and use the included screws. It is super easy to assemble each water bottle organizer together. KOK KAY offers the best value to our customers, if you have any other doubts or concerns, please don’t hesitate to contact our customer service team, we've got the best solution to make your day risk-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nr3Ls3iIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOK KAY","source_asin":"B0BH6DTKL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH6DTKL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH6DTKL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":821007,"name":"House, Home and More Skid-Resistant Carpet Indoor Area Rug Floor Mat - Chocolate Brown - 3 Feet X 3 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qTFtFZ+RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There’s no need to step lightly on your new carpet area rug from House, Home and More! Thanks to its non-slip rubber backing, this rug won’t bunch up or shift under your feet. Your household will appreciate the added stability in your living spaces, especially older adults. Our carpet area rugs protect and add comfort to hard-surface floors and help to reduce noise throughout your home. HOW TO CHOOSE AREA RUGS: Area rugs are great for high-traffic areas, like living rooms and entryways, and add comfort to kitchens, bedrooms and bathrooms. Rug size and color (or pattern) are relative to the size of the room and your personal design choices. In the living room, you generally want a rug size that extends immediately beyond the area of the furniture placed on top of it. When placing a rug (or rugs) in the kitchen or bathroom, you typically want to cover standing areas: in front of the sink or stove, just outside the shower or bathtub, etc. For a bedroom rug, strive for a size that extends beyond the sides and foot of the bed without going underneath nightstands. There are general design practices and recommendations, but in the end, these are personal style choices. ARE CARPET AREA RUGS PET FRIENDLY? Our area rugs provide stability and a cozy place for your pets to rest. The non-slip backing adds traction and creates a more secure setting for your household, including your dogs, cats and other pets. Walking on slippery hard-surface floors can be a difficult daily task for senior dogs and cats. The added comfort and grip of a rug will allow them to move with confidence. If you have pets, consider a color or design that won’t showcase their shedding. HOW TO CARE FOR YOUR CARPET AREA RUG: Our carpet area rugs feature a non-slip rubber backing which helps to keep them in place while vacuuming, but can become damaged if put into a washing machine. When your rug needs cleaning, we recommend vacuuming to remove surface dirt and spot cleaning areas that need extra care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qTFtFZ+RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"House, Home and More","source_asin":"B07C9JB14N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C9JB14N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C9JB14N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
