window.products.push({"id":821054,"name":"Bellemain Next-Gen No-Knife Mark Flexible Cutting Board Mats | Non-Skid with Food Color Codes (Set of 4) (15\"x11\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717YhfBQiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you love the convenience of a flexible cutting mat for transferring prepped ingredients to the pan, but hate how it slips all over your counter while you're chopping, Bellemain has the perfect solution. Sure Grip Bottom Ensuring your safety while you slice and chop, Bellemain Flexible Non-Skid Cutting Mats have a grid textured bottom that won't slip or slide on most types of countertop. (Simply place a dampened paper towel underneath.) Ultra Thick & Durable Rest assured, your knife won't cut right through Bellemain Flexible Non-Skid Cutting Mats, as often happens on the typical thin cutting mat. These are 1.1mm thick, yet still flexible so you can easily carry chopped ingredients from counter to stove. Plus, they won't warp or crack in the dishwasher. Food juices can't penetrate the non-porous surface, so you can enjoy meals that are not only hygienic, but also taste and smell they way they're supposed to. It's also naturally non-stick, allowing foods to slide effortlessly into the pan. Set of 4 Food-Coded Mats Avoid the health risks of cross-contamination by using a different mat for each food group. Colors and food icons help you keep track of which is which. Non-Toxic & Easy-Care Tough plastic construction is BPA-free, giving you peace of mind for your family's health. And it goes right in the dishwasher for one less cleaning chore. 5-Year Warranty Bellemain is dedicated to providing you with exceptional performance, quality and reliability. These Flexible Non-Skid Cutting Mats include a full replacement guaranteed if you're not satisfied in any way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717YhfBQiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bellemain","source_asin":"B08CRY7HSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CRY7HSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CRY7HSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
