window.products.push({"id":821097,"name":"Ubrand 2Pack Mini Bag Sealer, 2 In 1 Sealer And Cutter, Portable Bag Resealer Machine with Detachable Hook for Plastic Bags, Food Storage Snack Fresh ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ymr4wSpTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Concerns in Your Life 1.Do you worry about the leftover snacks and food storage? 2.Do you want to always keep your chips, snack and food fresh and crispy? Take it easy, our mini Heat Sealer for plastic bags help you clear away these issues! Mini Bag Sealer : The new 2021 Upgraded sealing machine uses safe ABS material, to provide you with excellent sealing performance, and keeps food fresh and flavorful. It's a good helper for our kitchen. Our Key Features : The Heat Sealer has the function of fast sealing and cutting. The Food Sealer Handheld is suitable for kitchens, offices, camping, traveling, picnics, etc. It's also equipped with a hook to hang it anywhere. Mini portable heat sealer for plastic can reuse the original bag, keep food and snacks fresh, longer, and reduce food waste. The sealer machine comes with a broken package function, tearing open no longer need to find scissors! Perfect replacement for open-cut scissors or other dangerous tools. Notice : 1) Please use the Alkaline battery, otherwise it will affect the performance. 2) Do not worry about the battery using, since it has the design of automatic disconnection after release. 3) Do not use it for heating more than 3 minutes at a time, and use it at intervals of 3-5minutes after each use. 4) This product is suitable for plastic bags of PE / PP / PVC, etc. but not for the pure paper bags and aluminum foil packaging bags. 5) The moving speed of the seal depends on the thickness of the plastic bag, the thinner you need to seal quickly, otherwise, it will break easily. The thick ones need to seal slowly, or they won’t be sealed. 6) Please scrape off the residual on the heating set for the better sealing effect. 7) Please replace the battery in time when the power is insufficient. 8) Please remove the battery when not in use for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ymr4wSpTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ubrand","source_asin":"B08R9GGFBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R9GGFBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R9GGFBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
