window.products.push({"id":821158,"name":"Sleemon Memory Foam Mattress Topper with Removable Bamboo Organic Cover, Double-Layer Breathable Firm Mattress Topper, Pain-Relief Mattress Toppers Fi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jS-rfOLBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High supportive double-layer design: Sleemon memory foam mattress topper adopts a double-layer design which has better support. Its upper layer is high resilience memory foam. Even if lying on it for a long time, it will not collapse. The lower layer is a highly supportive foam, which can better maintain the stiffness of the entire topper. The combination of these two layers can effectively provide support for the back, more suitable for people who like firm mattress toppers and people with bad backs. More cooling & Breathable: Do you still wake up because of the sweltering heat or wake up sweaty every day? Sleemon mattress topper queen can solve these problems for you. Our queen mattress topper is made of 40D high-density memory foam, which has more air holes. This allows air to circulate freely inside the foam so that make water evaporates faster to accelerate the cooling and sweat absorption effect. Removable bamboo fiber cover: We have equipped the mattress toppers with a removable, machine washable bamboo fiber cover. It can keep the interior of the mattressess topper queen memory foam clean and extend the life of the foam bed topper. Bamboo fiber material also has good breathability characteristics, you do not have to worry about the cover will affect the internal breathability. At the same time, this fabric is very soft, avoiding the pain caused by tossing and turning friction while sleeping. Improve sleep quality: Sleemon firm mattress topper queen is all designed to give you a more comfortable sleep. The double-layer, highly supportive design with a bamboo fabric cover allows it to provide you with relaxation, even body heat distribution, and quality sleep anytime and anywhere. A topper with a cover is better than a topper only for breathable and cooling. Instruction for use: Our memory foam mattress topper on the market is vacuum packed, please open it within 48 hours and leave it in a ventilated place for 24 hours to let it expand and ventilate. This firm mattress topper queen is suitable for everyone especially people who like to sleep on a firm topper or people with a bad lumbar spine, if you have any problems after receiving the goods please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jS-rfOLBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleemon","source_asin":"B0B5V5Z988","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5V5Z988","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5V5Z988","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
