window.products.push({"id":821160,"name":"KitchenAid KQ910 Backlit Instant Read Digital Food Kitchen Grill Thermometer, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518RhuC7lzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This KitchenAid backlit display digital instant read thermometer unites many thermometer functions in one reliable and trustworthy product. First, the oversized 1.0\" LCD readout displays the temperature boldly and clearly down to the tenth of a degree. Other features include an ultra-thin thermometer tip, handy pocket/storage sleeve that can also be used as a handle extension, and an F/C conversion switch. Combined with a temperature range that reaches a high 482 degrees farenheit, this thermometer will become one of the most useful precision tools in the kitchen. Helpful hints: digital thermometers are not meant to be left in food during cooking. The plastic and electronic components could be damaged with excessive heat. Important: thermometer will be hot after use. Use potholders or oven mitts when handling hot thermometer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518RhuC7lzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B095CBVW5P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095CBVW5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095CBVW5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":821161,"name":"Creative Structures PRADO STONEWARE COLLECTION - Collectible Kitchen Utensil Accessory Jar/Caddy/Holder - Chocolate Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZA17HbWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This kitchen utensil jar from the PRADO STONEWARE COLLECTION would make a wonderful gift to give or receive on any occasion. Each piece has been fired twice at high temperatures and they are completely finished by hand. Natural variations in color give each piece a unique personality. Use these beautiful, whimsical and durable wares for years to come. They are fashioned for both attractiveness and constant use. Prado Ceramics is a unique stoneware success story of the synergistic blending of stoneware designs from Rodo Padilla and Juan Prado. Prado, renown restauranteur of the very popular La Terraza de la Abuela, explored stoneware production possibilities for his restaurants with Rodo Padilla. While Padilla sought more time for creating fine art sculptures in his studio's, Juan Prado expanded his expertise in high temperature fired ceramics and eventually took over the stoneware production. The happy result of their relationship is the continuation of the ever popular Mug Tree and Accessories line by Padilla and the fabulous square tableware designs and bold new glazes from Prado.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZZA17HbWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Structures","source_asin":"B005R7QEK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005R7QEK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005R7QEK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
