window.products.push({"id":821183,"name":"Heated Blanket Electric Blanket Throw - Faux Fur 50\"x60\"Heating Blanket 5 Heating Settings& 8 Hours Auto Off Fast Heating Hidden Buckle Wearable&Blank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oOBDUmOXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FAUX FUR HEATED THROW: If you need a high-end electric throw blanket that is soft and silky, let's take a look at this heated blanket. Our heating blanket throw is made of 350GSM fluffy faux rabbit fur & 220GSM flannel. A smooth and soft plush electric blanket can help you fall asleep quickly and allow you to have a sweet dream. Premium faux fur feels extra soft and warm even after the blanket is powered off. It's a perfect choice to cuddle under during chilly days and nights. SMART HEATING CONTROL: Adjustable with 10 levels ranging from 59¡ãF - 131¡ãF, these heated blanket electric blanket offer the maximum comfort and warm sensation for all. Flexibly select between 1h, 2h, 4h, 6h, and 8h auto-off timer to keep safe and save energy. The wires of our warming blanket electric throws are arranged in a U-shape and the heat is evenly distributed. It takes only 5 minutes to rise to 131¡ãF, giving you a warm feeling in a short time. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL ELECTRIC BLANKET: Our heating electric throw blanket has a 100-inch super long detachable power cord that easily helps you reach nearby outlets, allowing for long-distance, versatile use. You can use electric blanket small on the couch, bed, office, RV, etc. You can remove the power cord and use it as a regular blanket on a warm day. It's a good choice to choose our adjustable heating faux fur throw blankets as a gift. WASHABLE ELECTRIC BLANKET: Made with durable material, the faux fur heated throw blankets(50x60) are easy to care for. Just remove the power cord and controller, put it in the washing machine and dry it, the grey faux fur throw can be as good as new. Do not dry, dry clean, bleach, or iron. Do not connect the power supply until the lightweight electric blanket is completely dry. TURN OFF and unplug while it is not in use. 100% SATISFACTION WARRANTY: If there is any problem with the heat blanket throw you purchased, please contact us in time, we will do everything to ensure you have a pleasant shopping experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oOBDUmOXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUJIPO","source_asin":"B0B7RD88HZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7RD88HZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7RD88HZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
