window.products.push({"id":821273,"name":"Luminarc Vinery Balloon 19-1/2-Ounce Glasses, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31S0A5JZX5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description VINERY is a brand new collection of stemware and wine accessories from Luminarc, developed originally for the food service and restaurant trade. The Very High Quality Glass is a patented formula that combines elegant design and the clarity of fine crystal, but with the strength and break-resistant durability of restaurant quality stemware. Each stem is dishwasher-safe over many repeated washings, and will resist clouding or pitting even after hundreds of washings. For elegance and durability, Vinery is the best value in the market. Amazon.com Balloon-shaped wine glasses create the widest surface area, allowing plenty of air exposure for red wine to breathe. These four 19-1/2-ounce balloons from the Vinery collection have another advantage-they're made of Luminarc's amazingly tough, break-resistant glass. When a party turns raucous or when children are running around, the worry about fragile stemware breaking is virtually eliminated. And, when the party's over, the glasses slip right into the dishwasher and won't cloud or pit even after years of use. The Vinery collection also includes a larger balloon glass, two sizes of tulip-shaped wines glasses, a Champagne flute, and a very modern decanter. Made in France for ARC International, Vinery is just one component of Luminarc, a brand known for its brightly colored and durable dinnerware, designed to be fun as well as practical for everyday living. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31S0A5JZX5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luminarc","source_asin":"B000HRZNGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HRZNGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HRZNGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":821274,"name":"EZ Sleep Travel Pillow - World's Most Effective Travel Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hygjhpKDL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"The EZ Sleep Travel Pillow is the most effective travel pillow ever invented. It works great and is easy to use. Blows up in about 3 or 4 breaths, installs easily between two seats or against the fuselage, straps to an armrest, then stays in place for an entire flight. No need to put that silly looking \"horse collar\" around your neck anymore. This pillow is simple, elegant, and effective. Just lean against it and be comfortable. Supports your whole upper body and not just your head. You instantly feel like sleeping. This is a game changer for people who fly and is soon to be the new high end standard for travel comfort! And then there's the privacy. Need a little privacy from the person next to you? Don't want them leaning on your shoulder? Well, here is the answer. Put one of these up and you will have that much needed bit of privacy that you wish you had before. If you don’t feel like putting it between you and your neighbor, you can always use it in the forward position, works great there too. Then when your flight's over, just deflate it, roll it up into an easy to carry bundle or just strap it to the handle of your carry-on, and you’re ready to go. Works great in a car, truck, train, bus, or even at the beach. This is the best travel pillow ever invented and the only one you will ever need. Nothing else even comes close!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hygjhpKDL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EZ Sleep Travel","source_asin":"B008JA2330","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008JA2330","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008JA2330","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
