window.products.push({"id":821321,"name":"Double Face Satin Ribbon 3/8\" Wide x 100 Yard Roll (300 FT Spool), Available in 20 Vibrant Colors for Choice (Hot Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bMs1XZ3lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Long description From floral design work, to party decorating, to gift wrapping, to decorating your Christmas tree, these bright color Satin Wired Ribbons which characterized by its shiny appearance are sure to bring true beauty to any of your decorative projects.  Cut this into many shapes and lengths for all sorts of unique and versatile craft projects. Dress curtains, pillows, hair decorations, photo booth, and even shoes! Label and organize closets and clothes hangers. Partner with invitations, thank-you notes, and bookmarks! This would also be a nice adornment wrapped around gifts styled into voluminous bows. For weddings and other special events, partner with corsages and boutonnieres. Let this ribbon assist in personalizing the stems of a bouquet, the pot of a vegetative arrangement, or the top of a vase. Create bows and even fabricate flowers to wear or to accessorize other decor. Utilize to attach tags to your decorative placeholders.  Festoon candle holders, soap dispensers, and Mason Jars. Make darling bows for picks, sprays, and garlands. Let this ribbon contribute to your voluminous mesh wreath projects! Craft a classy necklace by utilizing this ribbon to string through large beads of your choice! Choose the length of your necklace, and use the leftover ribbon to tie into a darling bow. Voila!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bMs1XZ3lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JDYYICZ","source_asin":"B07CZ8H9WT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZ8H9WT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CZ8H9WT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":821322,"name":"AMIR Digital Alarm Clock, LED Clock for Bedroom, Electronic Desktop Clock with Temperature Display, Adjustable Brightness, Voice Control for Heavy Sle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kRcg-50JL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"⏰ 【Large Display & Multi-function】Digital alarm clock with large LED display (6.3\"x0.7~1\"x2.36\"), which lets you check the time clearly at a glance even it is far from you. Our smart clock with 5 mode: clock mode, date mode, temperature mode, night mode (ON/OFF), alarm mode. The buttons on the rear are very self explanatory, so it is very easy to set up! ⏰ 【Adjustable Brightness】Just press UP/DOWN to adjust the three levels of brightness (Bright/ Medium /Low). Besides, the bedside alarm clock will auto dim during 18:00-6:00 when in the night mode, or you can set another periods of time for your need. Just press and hold the snooze button for more than 3 seconds to turn off the display to prevent the screen from lighting up at night to interfere with sleep. (NOTE: If you use a cable for power supply, the clock will always be on.) ⏰ 【Voice Control & Power Saving Mode】 When Powered by battery, you can get a extra function - voice control, which means you can activate the display by make some noise like clapping your hands, rapping on the table or touching the clock. In addition, the LED alarm clock will automatically turns off after 16 seconds of no operation and enters power saving mode, but the system still keeps normal timing and temperature and maintains the previous settings. ⏰ 【Voice Control & Power Saving Mode】 When Powered by battery, you can get a extra function - voice control, which means you can activate the display by make some noise like clapping your hands, rapping on the table or touching the clock. In addition, the LED alarm clock will automatically turns off after 16 seconds of no operation and enters power saving mode, but the system still keeps normal timing and temperature and maintains the previous settings. ⏰【USB & Battery Powered 】For this dual alarm clock, coming with 1meter/39.37inch power cord (AC adapter is not included)- very good for battery saving. And it comes with time memory function when you charge by AAA batteries.(When powered by USB alone, there is no time for memory function after power off).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kRcg-50JL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMIR","source_asin":"B0BBVWXZY4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBVWXZY4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBVWXZY4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
