window.products.push({"id":821414,"name":"HERA'S PALACE Swivel Bar Stool Set of 2, Modern Barstools with Adjustable Height, Counter Height Bar Chairs for Cafe, Kitchen, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h6SQicd1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☆ Swivel and Adjustable ☆ The 360° swivel design makes the chair flexibly turn to the right angle the adjustable height makes it perfect for any bar height. The stool adjusts easily up and down via a lever under the bottom of the seat for your pleasant and comfortable use. ☆ Gorgeous and Classy ☆ HERA’S PALACE swivel bar chairs are really gorgeous and elegant! When you place a few of these stools in your home, they will make your home look more premium, modern and minimalist. Your friends go to your home, they will definitely compliment you on your advanced aesthetics when they see this bar stool. You deserve to have them. ☆ Anti-Scratch Protector ☆ Bar stools with back are designed with anti-scratch protectors. Sleek galvanized steel plating base can firmly grasp the ground and rubber ring can keep floor from scratching. The chair base is made of black powder-coated solid steel to avoid rusting and bending over long periods of use. The footrest is welded to both legs with two contact points making the bar chairs modern more durable. ☆ Size and Weight ☆ The bar stool size is 37\"-44.8\"H x 15.7\"W which is suitable for 27\" to 47\" height tables. 2 Bar Chairs weight: 38.8 LBS. This bar height chair has a sturdy metal frame and can hold up to 350 pounds which can be used for years without issue. The leather seat is comfortable and super easy to clean. ☆ Multi-scene Application ☆ This adjustable swivel bar stools combine a modern design which can match any decoration or style, perfect for kitchen, dining room, bar, lounge, café and entertainment centers. The modern and simple chair design makes it look high-end and atmospheric, which can enhance the beauty of the space used. ☆ Super Easy Assembly ☆ There is an installation manual inside each box, please do not worry about the bar stool installation. The two cushion and two iron handrails with eight screws fixed up into L-shaped. Then install the frame to the seat cushion and tighten the corresponding four screws, tighten the air bar and base of the chair, and then assemble the two parts together to get a complete chair. The swivel bar stool set of 2 are really easy to put together. Both stools assemble in less than 15 minutes. ☆ Excellent Customer Service ☆ The pursuit of customer satisfaction is our greatest responsibility. HERA’S PALACE will provide you with fast after-sell customer service under the premise of quality assurance. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h6SQicd1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HERA'S PALACE","source_asin":"B0B2RKKCGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2RKKCGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2RKKCGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
