window.products.push({"id":821703,"name":"Brew Express Self-Filling Built In Coffee Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B2m7HEGjL._AC_.jpg","description":"The new Brew Express by Lance Larkin is the first Built-In-The-Wall drip Coffee Maker. This direct plumbed coffee maker features a large thermal carafe and brewing speicifations meeting the stringent standards set by the Specialty Coffee Association of America (SCAA) to give outstanding performance and the ultimate in convenience and style. Why is built-in better? The revolutionary new design of the Brew Express blends style, performance and convenience into an easy-to-use appliance that makes brewing coffee and hot beverages a pleasure instead of a burden. And because the Brew Express installs into the wall and hooks directly to your water supply, it also fits right into your life. You'll gain counter space and enjoy perfectly brewed coffee. All without spilling a drop of water. Features: All you add is coffee. The Brew Express self-fills on command, so you never add water. Then it lays down an even spread of hot water on the ground coffee beans at the perfect temperature. Extra Outlets. You always need more electrical outlets, so instead of taking one away, the Brew Express offers you two more. Programmable Timer/Clock. Wake up and smell the coffee! You can program the Brew Express to brew coffee and hot beverages at any time of day. Adjustable Cup Selector. Whether it's just you or a house full of company, the Brew Express lets you decide how much or how little coffee you want to brew. Select from a single cup, half or full pot, saving you coffee and time. Pause and Brew. The carafe can be safely removed while brewing, so you can get that first cup of coffee fast. If you forget to replace the carafe, no worries, the Brew Express will shut off automatically in five minutes. Stainless Steel Thermal Carafe. This is your go-anywhere carafe that can keep your coffee warm and fresh-tasting for hours. It's attractive and is equally at home on your countertop or your dining room table. Double wall stainless steel insulation. Cool Stainless Steel Pad. It's not a warmer...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B2m7HEGjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brew Express","source_asin":"B000FDN13A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FDN13A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FDN13A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
