window.products.push({"id":821937,"name":"Making the Cut Women's Season 2 Episode 2 Winning Look Joshua's Kimono","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H9fRfB86S._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Hosted by Heidi Klum and Tim Gunn, Season 2 of Making the Cut brings together 10 visionary and diverse designers. The contestants compete in design challenges that test both their design skills and their ability to run a fashion brand. Episode 2 Winning Look Designer Joshua Scacheri is an Australian-born designer with over 15 years of experience. In 2012, he moved to London, where he honed his craft of tailoring at some of the most iconic British heritage brands. His collections have graced international catwalks and have been featured in GQ, Harper's Bazaar, and Vogue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81H9fRfB86S._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Making the Cut","source_asin":"B096X3XJ63","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096X3XJ63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096X3XJ63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":821938,"name":"The Basics of Bead Stringing: A Complete Illustrated Approach for Beginner and Advanced Designers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZMVSEJANL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Basics of Bead Stringing, a long time best selling book on the art of creating professional-looking jewelry, has just undergone a complete revision. The new edition includes the latest tips and materials affecting the bead stringing craft. Traditional and contemporary techniques on multi-strand projects, knotted strands and wire wrapping are just a few of the highlighted features. Easy to understand instructions and complementary illustrations assure bead stringing success with the very first project. Learn how to select tools, beads and bead stringing materials. Master the basic techniques to create masterpieces. This book is suited for the beginner and professional jewelry crafter. Makes a great gift! Better than ever, new features include information on design and layout, updated instructions and drawings, and four new color photographs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZMVSEJANL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beadalon","source_asin":"0961535318","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/0961535318","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"0961535318","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":821939,"name":"DOUGHTY - Dough Kneading & Mixing Tool - Stainless Steel Hand Mixer - Ideal for Thick Sticky Doughs - Great Bread Kneading Tool & Danish Dough Whisk A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L55ggdGLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STAINLESS STEEL DOUGH KNEADER: Tired of messy hands while kneading sticky doughs? Our 11” long, rigid stainless steel tool & dough whisk makes it more effective in kneading and mixing thick and sticky dough, like Einhorn Sourdough. Our bread making tool will make kneading bread easier, is dishwasher safe & made from food grade stainless steel! DESIGNED WITH YOU IN MIND: As an avid baker, I was always frustrated with messy hands. That is why I specifically designed a longer, 11.” hand dough kneader with a 5\" oval handle for improved leverage and comfort. It will complete your Bread making tool kit, Danish Dough Whisk, Bread Proofing Basket, Bread Lame and Dough Scraper. EASY SCRAPING & STIRRING: Our dough mixer hand whisk will make scraping the side of bowls a breeze! The rigid edge easily scrapes up pockets of flour that like to hide in the bottom of mixing bowls. And since the tool has a hole in the middle, you can move effortlessly through your dough as you mix and stir. FOOD-GRADE STAINLESS STEEL: Our danish whisk for dough is made of premium, 304 grade stainless steel which meets European standards & guaranteed to last for years to come. Plus, our whisk has no gaps or wires that make cleaning a pain! When done, just throw it in the dishwasher for easy, effective cleaning! GREAT GIFT FOR BAKERS: We all have those avid bakers in our lives who would love our dough whisk large hand mixer! This sourdough bread baking tool comes in a cute gift box, making them a great Christmas gift idea for bakers! It can also be used as a pizza dough whisk or cookie dough mixer so you can get creative with all types of doughs in the kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L55ggdGLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Doughty","source_asin":"B08J3RDC8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J3RDC8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J3RDC8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":821940,"name":"Sanxian Airplane Seat Head Support Travel Pillow Super Soft -A Comfortable Safe Sleep Solution in Airplane and Office Easily Attachable Machine Washab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ynPU-T7VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✈️BEST TRAVEL HEAD SUPPORT – The SeatSleeper Travel Pillow is a scientifically proven travel pillow. Straps around the headrest so you can finally get quality sleep in your seat without head bobbing. ✈️UNIQUE DESIGN - The SeatSleeper Travel Pillow is made of two parts, the headrest that is attached to the airplane seat and a head strap which connects to it. When you are awake, the head strap is moved up above your head without disturbing you. ✈️BEST SLEEP - Super soft material combined with a forehead strap support, plus some high-density sponge on your ears creates a comfortable resting place for your head. Available in BLACK and GREY so you can find a color that suits your style. ✈️Perfect Fit - Easy to attach and easy to use. This patented design attaches to all kinds of airplane seats and easily adjusts to every head size. ✈️EASY CARE AND CARRYING - The SeatSleeper Travel Pillow is easy to attach to the handle of your backpack or outside of your luggage, and it only WEIGHS HALF A POUND (135 grams)! Say goodbye to bulky neck pillows taking up precious space in your carry on, or weighing you down at duty free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ynPU-T7VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sanxian","source_asin":"B07S2WJ4FX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S2WJ4FX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S2WJ4FX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
