window.products.push({"id":821959,"name":"Feng Shui Import Tai Sui Card 2018","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fbokb1swL._AC_SL1170_.jpg","description":"2018 is the year of the dog (├ª╦å┼á├ª╦å┼Æ├Ñ┬╣┬┤). The tai sui for 2018 is general Jiang Wu who is carrying one wat board in his hand (Wat board is the tool that person who needs to carry when he meets with the emperor. It is used as a notebook to write down important note on that wat board. Wet board is either made of jade, ivory or bamboo depending to the rank level). 2018 Tai Sui is sitting on NW position close to West. It afflicts to the dog zodiac and conflicts to dragon zodiac. Furthermore, Tai sui is also side against sheep zodiac and boar zodiac. If you are born in either year of dog, dragon, sheep or boar, one 2018 tai sui card with you is also highly recommended. The dimension of the 2018 feng shui card is approx. 3 1/8\" x 2\". It is made of thin metal coated with plastic.  See more  Amulet, Talisman  and  Talisman Cards","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fbokb1swL._AC_SL1170_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feng Shui Import","source_asin":"B078LDC8DX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-821959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078LDC8DX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078LDC8DX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
